  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">An increased perception that a rival (or adversarial) actor effectively controls the strait provokes executives to issue more frequent and forceful directives (rules-of-engagement changes, authorizations for operations) to reassert policy and military objectives.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
