  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">If perceptions shift toward stronger Iranian control of the strait, Israeli planners are likely to ratchet up offensive or preemptive operations against Lebanese fronts to signal deterrence and complicate Iran's ability to translate maritime control into wider leverage.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">israel_lebanon_conflict</data>
