  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained drop in Black Sea maritime throughput diverts commercial and military traffic into the southern/eastern Mediterranean, increasing transit density near Lebanese waters and triggering more Israeli interdiction and enforcement actions that raise the frequency of cross‑border incidents.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_blacksea</data>
  <data key="d40">israel_lebanon_conflict</data>
</edge>
