  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A drop in Black Sea maritime throughput (fewer transits/tonnage) directly incentivizes firms and states to diversify suppliers, ports and transit corridors to reduce exposure to chokepoint disruption.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_blacksea</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_rivalry</data>
