  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in Black Sea oil export flow raises global supply availability and reduces immediate tightness/risk premia in the crude market, putting downward pressure on benchmark oil prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
