  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher Black Sea seaborne oil volumes displace demand for some Persian Gulf loadings and tankers, lowering the volumetric flow that must transit the Strait of Hormuz.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_blacksea</data>
