  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased US/allied private and public investment in AI, sensors and drone production capacity accelerates manufacture and transfer (via contracts, aid, or export) of precision and loitering munitions to Ukraine and partners, raising the tempo and effectiveness of strikes against Russian maritime targets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_blacksea</data>
</edge>
